All datasets that are going to be used in the project to answer questions, make charts and visualizations

mar_mg_aa_cwh - Country level - gross weight of goods handled in all ports

nama_10_a64 - Country level - Gross value added and income by detailed industry 
  This dataset measures the economic details in all industries, we will use the Water transport(H50) and Warehousing and 
support activities for transportation(H52) to to investigate the maritime and port economy. Together they show how much income shipping and port-related businesses generate in each country. 
H50 water transport: sea, coastal and inland water transport of freight and passengers.
H52 warehousing and support activities for transportation: storage, cargo handling and port, terminal and other transport support services.




